    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d127">

                <pb facs="0222" n="200" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg200"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–851: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-08T18:00:00+01:00">December 8, 1951—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Delga 571. Re contributions, Delga 565.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d127-f1"/> Auth
                    to modify positions stated SD/A/C.5/170<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d127-f2"/> in line decisions last USGADel meeting requested. Modifications requested follow: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>US shld state opening session reasons for reduction US contribution to
                            33⅓ percent, request favorable consideration without tabling specific
                            proposal.</item>
                        <pb facs="0223" n="201" xml:id="pg201"/>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>If compromise offered by other delegations either as to percentage US
                            contribution or firm application of ceiling next year. USGADel shld give favorable
                            consideration to vote abstention with statement indicating abstention in
                            no way increases or changes existing charter obligation to make
                            payment.</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>If no compromise forthcoming, USGADel shld determine whether negative vote or abstention
                            shld be recorded. Discussions Roosevelt, Vorys and Mansfield with Rooney
                            Comite indicate package deal unacceptable to Appropriations
                            Comite.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>Necessary speak Monday on contributions and authorization urgently requested.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
